# | Moxa ioThinx 45MR-6600 — 6-channel RTD input
# | 
# | Source: ioThinx 4510 Series User's Manual V2.1, August 2019, Appendix A
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP via ioThinx 4510 adapter, port 502
# | 
# | IMPORTANT: Addresses are MODULE-RELATIVE. Actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address.
# | Slot base depends on which slot this module occupies in the ioThinx 4510 chassis.
# | 
# | FC01 (coil R/W): rtdResetMinValue ch0-5 (6 BOOL, W=1 to reset min tracking),
# | rtdResetMaxValue ch0-5 (6 BOOL, W=1 to reset max tracking)
# | FC03 (holding R/W): see [[registers]] below
# | FC04 (input R): rtdValueScaled ch0-5 (f32, 2 regs/ch = 12 regs),
# | rtdValueScaledMin ch0-5 (f32, 12 regs), rtdValueScaledMax ch0-5 (f32, 12 regs),
# | rtdType ch0-5 (6 WORD, 0=PT50 1=PT100 2=PT200 3=PT500 4=PT1000
@mbmap=1
