@model=ioThinx 45MR-6600
@vendor_website=moxa.com
@description=6-RTD input ioThinx 45MR slot module. Addresses are module-relative; actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address. FC01: rtdResetMinValue ch0-5 (W=1 to reset), rtdResetMaxValue ch0-5 (W=1 to reset). FC03: rtdResetMinValueAll (rel 0), rtdResetMaxValueAll (rel 1). FC04: rtdValueScaled ch0-5 (f32 2-regs/ch = 12 regs), rtdValueScaledMin (12 regs), rtdValueScaledMax (12 regs), rtdType ch0-5 (0=PT50 1=PT100 2=PT200 3=PT500 4=PT1000 14=310Ohm 15=620Ohm 16=1250Ohm 17=2200Ohm 20=JPT100 21=JPT200 22=JPT500 23=JPT1000 30=NI100 31=NI200 32=NI500 33=NI1000 34=NI120), rtdStatus ch0-5 (0=normal 1=burnout).
